OL,3,GNEWSAFeud death car passenger 'going
OL,4,Afor food'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager who was in a group of people
OL,7,Faccused of murdering a man as part of a
OL,8,Flong-running feud has told the trial he
OL,9,Fhad only expected to go out for "food
OL,10,Fand a drive" that day.
OL,12,FDaniel Ambler, 23, was crushed by a car
OL,13,Fdriven by Ashton Anderson at a petrol
OL,14,Fstation in Seaham, County Durham, in
OL,15,FJanuary, after months of incidents
OL,16,Fbetween their families, Teesside Crown
OL,17,FCourt heard.
OL,19,FAnderson, 20, his father Barry, 52, and
OL,20,Fbrother Logan, 19, deny murder, as do
OL,21,FTyler Leadbetter and Ajay Henry, both
OL,22,F18, who were passengers in the car.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,393,390,260,160,0,100
